WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.401 --> 00:00:04.865
(intense music)

00:00:04.865 --> 00:00:06.386
- Text me if you need anything.

00:00:06.386 --> 00:00:08.245
- Alright, bye loser.

00:00:08.245 --> 00:00:09.885
- Just tryin' to be a good older brother.

00:00:11.829 --> 00:00:12.793
- You must be Kelsey.

00:00:12.793 --> 00:00:14.591
Thanks so much for babysitting
at the last minute.

00:00:14.591 --> 00:00:15.288
- No problem.

00:00:15.288 --> 00:00:17.274
- Just make yourself at
home, if you need anything

00:00:17.274 --> 00:00:19.897
just Facebook message
me, or email works too,

00:00:19.897 --> 00:00:22.973
or you can Twitter DM me, or Instagram DM,

00:00:22.973 --> 00:00:25.359
or add me on Snapchat and send me a snap.

00:00:28.593 --> 00:00:31.792
(phone ringing)
(intense dark music)

00:00:31.792 --> 00:00:33.388
- What the hell?

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.739
What's voicemail?

00:00:44.016 --> 00:00:46.737
New phone, who dis?

00:00:47.985 --> 00:00:50.335
(phone ringing)

00:00:53.144 --> 00:00:55.163
Ben, have you been calling me?

00:00:55.163 --> 00:00:56.963
- Like from a phone, God no.

00:00:56.963 --> 00:00:58.785
- [Kelsey] Should I tweet the police?

00:00:58.785 --> 00:01:01.583
- Maybe it's just a customer
satisfaction survey.

00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:04.347
- [Kelsey] They left a voicemail.

00:01:04.347 --> 00:01:05.751
- Oh my God.

00:01:05.751 --> 00:01:08.350
Stay calm, you're safe inside that house.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:11.113
(phone ringing)

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:12.353
- Stop calling me you sick...

00:01:12.353 --> 00:01:14.131
- [Voiceover] Kelsey, it's the police.

00:01:14.131 --> 00:01:15.233
We've received multiple reports

00:01:15.233 --> 00:01:17.055
of phone calls in that location.

00:01:17.055 --> 00:01:19.366
It's all coming from the same number.

00:01:19.366 --> 00:01:21.712
(intense music)

00:01:21.712 --> 00:01:22.733
- [Kelsey] The internet's down.

00:01:22.733 --> 00:01:24.266
I can't send Snapchats.

00:01:24.266 --> 00:01:25.671
(screams)

00:01:28.211 --> 00:01:32.851
(intense exciting music)

00:01:34.516 --> 00:01:35.876
(screams)

00:01:36.521 --> 00:01:39.203
- [Voiceover] Kelsey, is that you?

00:01:39.203 --> 00:01:40.306
It's your nana.

00:01:40.306 --> 00:01:41.261
- Nana!

00:01:42.891 --> 00:01:45.550
You need to learn how to (beep) text!

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:48.084
(intense music)

